Smart2city was founded in 2018 by the serial entrepreneur Raphael Kling with two core beliefs; 
1 That the education sector should be aware of and have access to emerging technology; 
2 That the application of emerging technology has the power to be extremely beneficial for society.
Through fully immersive experiences integration (VR Visuals, smells, 3D audio and advanced signal processing to interpret mental activity) and disruptive designs smart2city aims to enable more efficient, engaging and interactive education.
